{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261016/photo/bkn-20261016233048752-1016_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261016235449\"/><p>蘋果旗艦摺疊機 iPhone Duo於本周五（16日）晚上8時開放預購，引發搶購熱潮。有網民在社交平台反映，收到匯豐銀行發出兩次的信用卡扣款短訊34,998港元，懷疑信用卡被盜用，遂致電客服，惟未有人接聽；亦有網民表示收到5次扣款短訊。</p><p>此次事件與上次iPhone 18Pro及Pro Max開售後出現的大規模信用卡被盜用情況相似。相關機構正跟進調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T15:59:47.513958+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T15:30:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T15:57:43.543514+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T15:57:43.543514+00:00","content_hash":"46393f13229cc5aa466ccdb0cd1ce34e4934d7efc14a80b4079b81a212dba411","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}